      "name": "French",
      "colour": "#2f4d8f",
      "brief": "Hold the plateau until Rey's column comes up from Castelnuovo. They outnumber you and they cannot help each other: three lanes off the heights that only meet where you are standing, and a fourth coming up the gorge one man wide past the chapel. Beat them as they arrive, and keep something in hand for the one that walks on behind you.",
