    {
      "id": "austrian",
      "name": "Austrian",
      "colour": "#e3e7ef",
      "brief": "Six columns on one plateau, and the ground has already decided that they arrive separately. The gullies part your line until it is down on the flat, the Adige road is a defile a battalion has to file up, and Lusignan is behind them and alone until you reach him. Come down together or be beaten in detail. The chapel is the gate, and Rivoli is what the day is counted on.",
